{% set speakingNpc = decnpc(npc.UUID) %}
{% set nearby = get_nearby_actors(npc.UUID) %}
A nearby person puts a new leash on {{speakingNpc.name}}. That person either holds it or leaves it hanging (holder None). Use when someone else collars the speaker, not when the speaker collars someone else.
Available actors (who puts the collar on): {{ nearby.actorsNameString }}.
Holder must be that same actor or None. Never pick {{speakingNpc.name}} as holder. Never pick anyone not listed except None.
